OL,4,G2100FRiley & Coe
OL,5,     GMarc Riley and Gideon Coe come
OL,6,     Gtogether to play their music
OL,7,     Gloves from every era and genre.
OL,8,G2300FJourneys in Sound
OL,9,     GHAAi shares the music that has
OL,10,     Gsound-tracked her life, with
OL,11,     Gpsychotherapist and DJ Nemone.
OL,12,     GThe two dive deep into her latest
OL,13,     Grecord, the highly acclaimed and
OL,14,     Gbrilliant HUMANiSE.
OL,15,G0000FFreak Zone Playlist
OL,16,     GLisa Meyer, artistic director and
OL,17,     Gco-founder of Birmingham's
OL,18,     GSupersonic Festival previews some
OL,19,     Gof the acts playing this year's
OL,20,     Gevent.
